                                                "example_id": "0bf017d1-0567-4fd9-ae93-5777fabdb098",
                                                "sense_id": "37faa743-be34-3763-9c8b-69eb5b2c5f45",
                                                "text": "“Yes, his heart is one of galactic proportions.”"
